WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.279
In the summer of 1976, the city of New York
was thrown into a state of terror.

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:09.320
A madman was on the loose, wandering the streets
and killing people at random.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.459
This was a killer who loved publicity, sending
vicious, taunting letters to the police and

00:00:14.459 --> 00:00:15.459
media.

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:17.850
Each one was signed with the moniker ‘Son
of Sam’.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.150
When fate finally caught up with the monster,
he was revealed to be a chubby introvertby

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.830
the name of David Berkowitz.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:29.670
In this week’s Biographics we discover his
story.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:39.440
The Early Years

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.100
The child who would become the Son of Sam
was born Richard David Falco on June 1st,

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.100
1953.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.500
His mother, Betty Broder, had previously been
married to a man named Tony Falco, but when

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.710
he left her for another woman she began a
relationship with a married man named Joseph

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:54.710
Kleinman.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:58.780
Betty and Tony already had a child, Roslyn
and when Kleinman found out that she was pregnant

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:01.590
again he pressured her give the baby up for
adoption.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:05.690
It appears that he also forbade Betty from
giving the child his name, which is why she

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.300
gave the child her former husband’s last
name.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:13.350
A few days after birth, Richard was adopted
by a middle aged couple named Nathan and Pearl

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.690
Berkowitz, who lived in New York’s Bronx.

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:20.340
The Berkowitz’s owned a hardware store,
which occupied a large portion of Nathan’s

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.340
time.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.980
He was never close to his adopted son, who
was known by his middle name David, considering

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:25.680
the adoption to be a ‘mistake’.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:29.560
As David was her only child, Pearl was extremely
close to the boy..

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.880
She indulged David and let him get away with
things he shouldn’t have.

00:01:33.880 --> 00:01:35.860
David developed into a difficult child.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.640
He was hyperactive, mischievous and ornery.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:43.210
He was a bulky child and quickly learned that
he could use his size to his advantage and

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:44.650
lord it over other children.

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:49.170
He showed little interest in schooling and,
through a combination of truancy and feigned

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.870
illnesses, missed a lot of class time.

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.320
When he was seven years old, David was hit
by a car and suffered head injuries.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.970
It is unclear whether this resulted in long
term effects.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:03.410
Soon after he started to show signs of a fascination
with fire.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:07.190
He began burning bugs and advanced to starting
fires around his neighborhood.

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:11.310
None of this activity brought him to the attention
of the authorities, though his adoptive parents

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.450
did on one occasion take time to see a psychotherapist.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:18.030
When he was fourteen, David’s life was turned
upside down with the death of his adoptive

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:19.030
mother.

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.140
Pearl had been fighting breast cancer for
two years.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:25.310
Pearl was the only person with whom David
had a close relationship and he was shocked

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:28.090
to watch her decline as she went through chemotherapy
treatment.

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.640
Her death was a crushing blow for him.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:34.360
In the year after his mother’s death, David
became increasingly introverted.

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:38.240
His school work suffered drastically and he
fell into a dark depression.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:42.670
He had no relationship with his father and
things worsened when Joseph remarried.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.540
His new step-mother was even more distant
than his father.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.090
When the family relocated to Boynton Beach
near Miami, Florida, David’s isolation became

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.090
complete.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:55.090
With no friends and no family connection,
he created a fantasy world in order to cope

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.310
with his loneliness.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:01.560
In 1971, at the age of 18, David found a means
to escape his dismal life with his father

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.560
and step-mother.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.660
He joined the army and, after basic training,
was sent to Korea.

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.050
Army life was transformative for the troubled
young man.

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.069
He seemed to respond well to the discipline
that it provided and generally equipped himself

00:03:13.069 --> 00:03:14.069
well.

00:03:14.069 --> 00:03:15.850
He trained as a marksman and became a good
shot.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:19.030
In 1974 he was honorably discharged.

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.630
After leaving the army, David returned to
New York.

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.430
Here he was completely on his own.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.610
He used money he had saved during his army
years to rent an apartment in the Bronx and

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.120
took classes at Bronx Community College.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:35.090
People remember him at this time as an angry
and argumentative young man who shunned association

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.090
with others.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:39.620
To support himself, he worked a number of
odd jobs including mail sorter, security guard

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:40.680
and cab driver.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.340
Though very private, Berkowitz quickly came
to the attention of his neighbors and the

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.770
local police department.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:49.630
He would instigate petty disputes and escalate
them with personal threats.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:53.640
A man who lived on the floor below, Deputy
Police Sheriff Charles Glassman, received

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.630
four hand-written threats from Berkowitz.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.880
Inhis early twenties, Berkowitz connected
with his birth mother.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:02.130
He began regular visits with Betty and his
half-sister Rosalyn.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:05.500
However, when he found out that Betty had
given him up for adoption after succumbing

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:09.020
to pressure from his birth father, he did
not react very well.

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:14.050
In fact, he cut the two women out of his life
completely, never visiting again.

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.630
In 1974, Berkowitz’s fascination with fire
resurfaced.

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:23.370
Over the next three years he set more than
1,500 fires around New York City.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:27.310
David diligently recorded the details of each
arson in his journal, referring to himself

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:29.270
as ‘The Phantom of the Bronx’.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:33.620
Fire lighting gave him the sense of control
over a situation that he could find nowhere

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.850
else in life.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:40.340
In 1975, Berkowitz developed another fascination,
this time with the occult.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.930
After reading the Satanic Bible by Anton LaVey,
the founder of the Church of Satan, he became

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:50.090
convinced that he was being controlled by
evil spirits.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:54.620
First Attack

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:58.720
In late November, 1975, Berkowitz wrote a
letter to his father.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.720
In it he said . . .

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.840
“It's cold and gloomy here in New York,
but that's okay because the weather fits my

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.270
mood — gloomy.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.139
Dad, the world is getting dark now.”

00:05:08.139 --> 00:05:12.940
A month later, on Christmas Eve, he took hold
of a hunting knife and headed out to satisfy

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.150
his blood lust.

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.980
His first victim was a woman coming out of
a grocery store.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:20.310
Berkowitz stabbed her several times before
she managed to run away.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:23.440
He then came across a fifteen year-old by
the name of Michelle Forman.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:28.699
She was stabbed six times but fought off her
attacker and made it to the safety of a nearby

00:05:28.699 --> 00:05:29.699
apartment.

00:05:29.699 --> 00:05:34.980
At the end of January, 1976, Berkowitz relocated
from the Bronx to a rental house in Yonkers.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:38.600
His landlords owned a German Shepherd dog
which barked incessantly.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.180
Berkowitz would later state that the dog was
possessed by Satan and through its barking

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.210
had commanded him to kill young women.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.470
At the time he was a working night shift job
as a security guard.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:51.430
He recalled that the constant barking almost
caused him to take his own life.

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:55.010
After three months, the noise was too much
for Berkowitz and he moved to an apartment

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:57.370
at 35 Pine Street at Yonkers.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.380
As it turned out, he was unable to escape
the barking of dogs, further convincing him

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.560
that this was the signal that Satan was using
to drive him to murder.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:07.400
He used a molotov cocktail to try to kill
the dog belonging to his neigbor, a man named

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.430
Sam Carr.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.470
When this didn’t work he shot the dog.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:15.430
Berkowitz was convinced that Sam Carr was
possessed by the Devil and it was from him

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.810
that he came up with the name ‘Son of Sam’.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:22.790
His two botched knife attacks convinced Berkowitz
that he needed a more effective means of killing.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:28.030
By June of 1976 he had built up a formidable
arsenal of firearms that included a .44 caliber

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:33.360
revolver, Commando Mark III rifle, a Glenfield
rifle with telescopic sight, Charter Arms

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:37.910
AR-7 Explorer Shotgun and a 12-gauge Ithaca
Deerslayer shotgun.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:42.940
Towards the end of June, 1976, Berkowitz quit
his job as a security guard and began driving

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:44.780
for the Co-Op City Taxi Company.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:46.940
But that job didn’t last long.

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:51.160
By the end of July he was working a day-job
as an installer of air conditioning ducts.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.810
Berkowitz’ first kill occured on July 29th,
1976.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:07:00.229
He had left his apartment via the fire escape
shortly before 1am with his .44 caliber handgun

00:07:00.229 --> 00:07:03.880
in a paper bag, hopping into his car and cruising
for a victim.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:08.690
He came across 18-year-old Donna Lauria and
her 19-year-old friend Jody Valenti, talking

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.580
in a car outside Donna’s apartment.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:15.150
Berkowitz approached Donna’s side window,
squatted down into a firing position and,

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.810
holding the gun with both hands, emptied the
chamber.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.240
Donna was shot and killed..

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:23.419
Jody, wounded, reacted by screaming and desperately
honking the car horn.

00:07:23.419 --> 00:07:24.730
Jody survived.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:27.210
With his gun empty, Berkowitz melted away
into the night.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.110
He was filled with a euphoria that he had
never known before.

00:07:30.110 --> 00:07:33.740
His addiction to murder was well under way.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:39.030
A Litany of Murder

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:42.389
The next attack came three months later, on
October 23rd.

00:07:42.389 --> 00:07:45.900
Berkowitz was again cruising for a victim
in the dead of night.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:50.020
He was driving down a street in Flushing,
Queens when he spotted two people in a red

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:54.050
Ford Galaxie.One of them had long black hair,
which he found attractive.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:57.990
He began following them and, when they came
to a stop, he parked behind them.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.290
Berkowitz had set his sights on twenty year
old Carl Denaro and his eighteen year old

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:07.080
date Rosemary Keenan, who happened to be the
daughter of a New York City Police Officer.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:10.610
Following the same pattern of his first murder,
Berkowitz approached the passenger window,

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:13.669
pulled out his handgun and fired five times.

00:08:13.669 --> 00:08:17.580
One of the bullets smashed into Carl’s head,
but an uninjured Rosemary managed to escape

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.009
the car and flee.

00:08:19.009 --> 00:08:22.310
When Berkowitz left, she returned and drove
Carl to the hospital.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:26.449
Amazingly he survived, with doctors having
to insert a metal plate into his skull.

00:08:26.449 --> 00:08:28.639
A month later, Berkowitz struck again.

00:08:28.639 --> 00:08:34.240
This time his victims were a couple of teenage
girls, Joanne Lomino and Dona DeMasi, on their

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:35.839
way home from the movies.

00:08:35.839 --> 00:08:40.060
Berkowitz walked behind them and, as they
stood on the stoop of Joanne’s house talking,

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.949
he opened up with his handgun.

00:08:41.949 --> 00:08:43.919
Then he disappeared.

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:47.360
Bullets tore through the bodies of both girls
but neither was killed, although Joannewas

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.519
paralyzed from the waist down.

00:08:49.519 --> 00:08:51.149
The attacks continued.

00:08:51.149 --> 00:08:56.699
On January 30, 1977, Berkowitz shot and killed
Christine Freund, who had just seen the movie

00:08:56.699 --> 00:08:57.850
‘Rocky’ with her boyfriend.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.970
As with most of the previous attacks, the
couple were sitting in their car when Berkowitz

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.389
opened fire.

00:09:03.389 --> 00:09:08.730
On March 8th, he killed an 20 Bulgarian immigrant
by the name of Virginia Voskerichian.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:13.790
Virginia was walking home from Columbia University
when she came face to face with Berkowitz.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:18.879
He shot her in the face at point blank range
and then left her to die on the sidewalk.Then,

00:09:18.879 --> 00:09:23.940
on April 17th, he attacked Valentina Suriani
and Alexander Esau as they sat in their car

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:24.940
at 3am.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:29.389
Suriana died at the scene while Esau died
hours later.Police were quickly on the scene.

00:09:29.389 --> 00:09:31.929
There they found a letter that had been left
by the killer.

00:09:31.929 --> 00:09:33.149
It read in part . . .

00:09:33.149 --> 00:09:34.160
I am a monster.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:36.920
I am the "son of Sam"…I feel like an outsider.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:41.399
I am on a different wavelength then everybody
else - programmed to kill.

00:09:41.399 --> 00:09:43.769
However, to stop me you must kill me...

00:09:43.769 --> 00:09:46.869
I am the "monster" - "Beelzebub" - the chubby
behe- mouth.

00:09:46.869 --> 00:09:48.100
I love to hunt.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.319
Prowling the streets looking for fair game
- tasty meat.

00:09:51.319 --> 00:09:54.209
The wemon of Queens are prettiest of all...

00:09:54.209 --> 00:09:58.449
Hunt for the Son of Sam

00:09:58.449 --> 00:10:02.620
By now, the entire city of New York was in
an uproar.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:07.699
Fear over the next attack by the Son of Sam
led to a rush on hand-gun sales and a dramatic

00:10:07.699 --> 00:10:09.899
emptying of night time entertainment venues.

00:10:09.899 --> 00:10:13.819
The information that the majority of victims
had long dark hair led to an overnight hair

00:10:13.819 --> 00:10:17.519
style change, as women rushed to get their
hair-cut and dyed.

00:10:17.519 --> 00:10:20.569
The media was all over the story, with coverage
going global.

00:10:20.569 --> 00:10:24.120
But still, the attacks continued with chilling
regularity.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.790
Berkowitz next struck on June 26, 1977.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:33.790
Judy Placido, 17, and Sal Lupo, 20, were sitting
in Lupo’s car around 3am when Berkowitz

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.249
attacked in his usual way.

00:10:35.249 --> 00:10:38.910
Placido was shot three times, while Lupo was
shot once.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:39.940
Both survived.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:44.399
A month later, he attacked Bobby Violante
and Stacy Moskowitz, both aged twenty.

00:10:44.399 --> 00:10:49.040
Again, Berkowitz fired through the passenger
car window, striking both victims in the head.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:55.050
Violante survived though he lost 90% of his
vision but Stacy Moskowitz died two days later.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:58.009
She was the last victim of the Son of Sam.

00:10:58.009 --> 00:11:03.779
On March 30, 1977 media hysteria was ratcheted
even further when New York’s most prominent

00:11:03.779 --> 00:11:08.069
crime writer, New York Times columnist Jimmy
Breslin received a handwritten letter from

00:11:08.069 --> 00:11:10.000
a person claiming to be the Son of Sam.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.860
It including the following . . .
Mr. Breslin, sir, don't think that because

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.790
you haven't heard from me for a while that
I went to sleep.

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:19.209
No, rather, I am still here.

00:11:19.209 --> 00:11:21.339
Like a spirit roaming the night.

00:11:21.339 --> 00:11:25.660
Thirsty, hungry, seldom stopping to rest;
anxious to please Sam.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.860
I love my work.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:28.930
Now, the void has been filled.

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:32.850
Perhaps we shall meet face to face someday
or perhaps I will be blown away by cops with

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.850
smoking .38's.

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:38.421
Breslin contacted the police, who noted that
the letter contained details of some of the

00:11:38.421 --> 00:11:40.930
crimes that had not been released to the public.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:45.319
They allowed The Times to publish part of
the letter as a companion to Breslin’s printed

00:11:45.319 --> 00:11:47.920
response, which urged the killer to turn himself
in.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:51.550
That edition of The Times sold more than a
million copies.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:56.329
The NYPD formed Operation Omega, the most
comprehensive investigation in its history

00:11:56.329 --> 00:11:58.899
in order to bring the Son of Sam to justice.

00:11:58.899 --> 00:12:03.499
Over 300 detectives worked around the clock
at a daily cost of $90,000.

00:12:03.499 --> 00:12:08.839
45 psychiatrists poured over the taunting
letters that Berkowitz was writing with the

00:12:08.839 --> 00:12:13.259
general consensus being that he was a paranoid
loner who was unable to form relationships

00:12:13.259 --> 00:12:16.089
and with possible connections to devil worship.

00:12:16.089 --> 00:12:20.529
On the night of the Moskowitz, Violante shooting,
a woman named Cecilia Davis was walking her

00:12:20.529 --> 00:12:24.680
dog when she saw a police officer ticketing
a young man in a car that was parked alongside

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:25.680
a fire hydrant.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.790
Soon thereafter she saw what appeared to be
that same young man walk past her and staring

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:30.790
at her menacingly.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:33.769
It was enough to scare her into a speedy dash
for home.

00:12:33.769 --> 00:12:36.509
After the murders, Miss Davis gave the information
to the police.

00:12:36.509 --> 00:12:41.309
As a result, every driver that had been ticketed
that night was brought in for questioning.

00:12:41.309 --> 00:12:46.779
One of the people on that list was David Berkowitz.

00:12:46.779 --> 00:12:50.249
Arrest

00:12:50.249 --> 00:12:53.730
A detective tried to get hold of Berkowitz
over the phone but there was no answer.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:58.131
The detective then contacted the Yonkers Police
Station to see if they could help him get

00:12:58.131 --> 00:12:59.779
in touch with Berkowitz.

00:12:59.779 --> 00:13:04.129
The dispatcher he spoke to just happened to
be the daughter of Sam Carr, David’s former

00:13:04.129 --> 00:13:08.999
landlord and the inspiration for the Son of
Sam label that Berkowitz had anointed himself

00:13:08.999 --> 00:13:09.999
with.

00:13:09.999 --> 00:13:14.000
The detective interviewed Sam Carr, who informed
him that Berkowitz had shot his dog and was

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.809
a pretty troubled individual.

00:13:15.809 --> 00:13:20.819
The physical and psychological description
that was given seemed to gel with the profile

00:13:20.819 --> 00:13:22.170
of the Son of Sam.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.230
From this point on, evidence against Berkowitz
quickly mounted.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:29.299
A suspected arson was reported close to his
apartment.Police interviewed David’s former

00:13:29.299 --> 00:13:33.329
neighbor, Charles Glassman, who showed them
the nasty letters that Berkowitz had written

00:13:33.329 --> 00:13:38.879
to him.On August 10, 1977, detectives found
his Ford Galaxie parked outside his apartment..

00:13:38.879 --> 00:13:42.660
Though they didn’t have a search warrant,
they began searching the car.

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:47.209
On the back seat was a duffle bag containing
a rifle.Inside the glove compartment was a

00:13:47.209 --> 00:13:51.020
handwritten letter addressed to the Suffolk
County Police Department that warned of a

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.790
coming attack on a disco.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:56.489
One of the officers was sent to get a search
warrant while the officers stayed by the car.

00:13:56.489 --> 00:14:00.619
A member of the public was told to park his
car so as to box in the Ford, making it hard

00:14:00.619 --> 00:14:03.499
for Berkowitz to get away if he came out of
his apartment.

00:14:03.499 --> 00:14:05.449
A SWAT team was deployed around the area.

00:14:05.449 --> 00:14:10.160
Finally, at around 10:30 pm, Berkowitz came
out of his apartment and got into his car.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.730
A detective approached and tapped on his window.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:16.309
The Son of Sam rolled down the window and
said, ‘Well,you got me.

00:14:16.309 --> 00:14:21.189
How come it took you such a long time?’

00:14:21.189 --> 00:14:27.279
Prison
The arrest of the Son of Sam caused a worldwide

00:14:27.279 --> 00:14:28.279
sensation.

00:14:28.279 --> 00:14:30.989
It turned out of that the monster who had
terrorized the world’s most famous city

00:14:30.989 --> 00:14:33.600
was a rather pathetic looking loner.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.609
Berkowitz admitted to all of the attacks,
providing details that only the perpetrator

00:14:37.609 --> 00:14:38.609
would know.

00:14:38.609 --> 00:14:42.879
On August 11th he was charged with second-degree
murder for the killing of Stacy Moskowitz.

00:14:42.879 --> 00:14:47.040
The judge ordered a psychological evaluation
to determine if he was fit to stand trial.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:51.410
Meanwhile, the media was in a frenzy to cover
every angle of the Son of Sam story.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:55.769
This resulted in the state of New York enacting
what became known as the Son of Sam laws,

00:14:55.769 --> 00:15:00.449
permitting the state to confiscate the proceeds
from any earnings made as proceeds of crime

00:15:00.449 --> 00:15:03.329
for a period of five years after the act was
committed.

00:15:03.329 --> 00:15:06.149
The money would go to the victims of the crime.

00:15:06.149 --> 00:15:08.569
As it turned out there was to be no trial.

00:15:08.569 --> 00:15:12.699
Berkowitz pled guilty to six counts of murder
and refused the urging of his attorney to

00:15:12.699 --> 00:15:14.029
claim a defense of insanity.

00:15:14.029 --> 00:15:17.759
He later stated . . .
“I just wanted to end it, and I was just

00:15:17.759 --> 00:15:18.759
so distraught.

00:15:18.759 --> 00:15:22.639
I just confessed and pled guilty and got it
over with, and -- just wanted to get out of

00:15:22.639 --> 00:15:24.160
that environment.”

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:27.129
During his sentencing, the mother of Stacy
Moskowitz stood up and said . . .

00:15:27.129 --> 00:15:30.859
“I could kill him with my bare hands, and
I am not a violent person.

00:15:30.859 --> 00:15:36.489
I could probably kill him and go for a dinner
and go to sleep that night truly peacefully.”

00:15:36.489 --> 00:15:41.419
During Mrs Moskowitz's statement, Berkowitz
repeated over and over, ‘Stacey is a whore’.

00:15:41.419 --> 00:15:44.720
Then he burst from his seat and made for the
courtroom window.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:48.679
He was eventually restrained but not before
knocking down several officers.

00:15:48.679 --> 00:15:54.429
Sentencing was delayed until June 12th, 1978,
on which date he was sentenced to six consecutive

00:15:54.429 --> 00:15:55.749
life sentences.

00:15:55.749 --> 00:15:57.850
Berkowitz proved to be a problem prisoner.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:00.279
He reveled in tormenting other inmates.

00:16:00.279 --> 00:16:03.679
Because of his rage, other inmates referred
to him as ‘Berserkowitz’.

00:16:03.679 --> 00:16:07.639
On July 10th, 1979 he was attacked by another
inmate with a razor.

00:16:07.639 --> 00:16:11.759
The resulting neck injury required 57 stitches.

00:16:11.759 --> 00:16:14.929
After ten years of confinement, Berkowitz
became a born-again Christian.

00:16:14.929 --> 00:16:19.139
The angry mass killer was converted into an
evangelical pacifist.

00:16:19.139 --> 00:16:22.999
He absorbed himself in a letter writing campaign
to spread the message of the Bible.

00:16:22.999 --> 00:16:27.709
Over the years, a following developed around
Berkowitz as the ultimate example of the changed

00:16:27.709 --> 00:16:31.149
man, the modern day equivalent of the Apostle
Paul.

00:16:31.149 --> 00:16:34.160
Berkowitz first became eligible for parole
in 2002.

00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:38.189
However, he sent a letter to the parole board
requesting that the hearing be cancelled.

00:16:38.189 --> 00:16:42.069
In it, he stated . . .
In all honesty, I believe that I deserve to

00:16:42.069 --> 00:16:43.989
be in prison for the rest of my life.

00:16:43.989 --> 00:16:49.540
I have, with God's help, long ago come to
terms with my situation and I have accepted

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:50.540
my punishment.

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:56.089
He has been up for parole every two since
2002 but he has consistently refused the opportunity

00:16:56.089 --> 00:16:57.309
to seek his freedom.

00:16:57.309 --> 00:17:20.120
As a result he remains in prison to this day,
where he is considered to be a model prisoner.

